              "exact_quote": "UK bond offers a 10 percent interest rate. US bond offers a 5 percent interest rate."
            },
            {
              "note_id": "FCT_0003",
              "exact_quote": "If I go the UK bond route, I get 10% in return in the bond, minus 5% in the capital loss due to the appreciation of the dollar."
            },
            {
              "note_id": "FCT_0004",
              "exact_quote": "So net I get 5% as well."
            },
            {
              "note_id": "FCT_0049",
